       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 100.00.
       01  WS-TOTAL  PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LINE.
           PERFORM CALCULATE.
           DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
           STOP RUN.
       CALCULATE.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-AMOUNT * 2.
           IF WS-AMOUNT > 0
               DISPLAY 'VALID'
           END-IF.
